# Dung voi VS Code REST Client hoac Visual Studio (.http). Chay API truoc: dotnet run --project src/AiOralExam.Api
@host = http://localhost:5080

### Dang nhap sinh vien (chua thi) -> copy accessToken vao @token
POST {{host}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "han.hg@aives.edu.vn", "password": "Password@123" }

###
@token = paste-access-token-here

### Phien thi cua toi
GET {{host}}/api/interview/my-sessions
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Tao luot thi (phien SWD392 dang mo)
POST {{host}}/api/interview-attempts
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "examSessionId": "33333333-0000-0000-0000-000000000001" }

### Nop cau tra loi (thay attemptId)
POST {{host}}/api/interview-attempts/ATTEMPT_ID/responses
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "answerText": "Modular monolith triển khai một khối nhưng chia module rõ ràng theo nghiệp vụ, mỗi module giữ bảng riêng và chỉ gọi nhau qua interface." }

### Health check
GET {{host}}/health
